  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Cooperation Council 2026 - Regional Cooperation Council 2026 new finance code</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regional Cooperation Council 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RCC is an intergovernmental organisation in south eastern Europe (SEE) aimed at helping prosperity and growth through regional action in SEE, while advancing European and Euro-Atlantic integration. Through this contribution, Sida has a seat in RCC&apos;s board.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RCC &#xe4;r en mellanstatlig organisation i syd&#xf6;stra Europa (SEE) med m&#xe5;let att bidra till tillv&#xe4;xt genom regionala insatser i SEE, men ocks&#xe5; att avancera Europeisk och Euro-Atlantic integration. Genom denna insats har Sida en plats i RCC:s styrelse.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RCC&apos;s overall objective is to develop and maintain a political climate of dialogue, reconciliation, tolerance and openness towards cooperation, with a view to enabling the implementation of programmes of regional character aimed at economic and social development to the benefit of the people in the region. 

The overarching goal of the strategy 2026-2028 is Smart, Skilled and Sustainable: Resilience through Transformation and Development.</narrative>
  </description>
